{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107700","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107700","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710770001:1":{"text":"一体、何があったのですか？先ほどまで、ホールには誰一人おりませんでした。今までどちらにいらしたのですか？","source_cn":"请原谅我的惊讶。但就在刚才，这座大厅还空无一人。可否请...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB3532B15F6B7526","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710770002:1":{"text":"皆様のお顔色を拝見するに……晩餐会を楽しまれていたわけではなさそうですが……","source_cn":"看你们的神色，并非在享受一场美妙的晚宴啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE38A45EAE08BC66B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710770003:1":{"text":"ディアグレス様！ちょうどいいところに！ ","source_cn":"迪尔格雷大人！您来得正好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6B8DD85A9E8AD79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710770004:1":{"text":"わ、私たちは、さっきまで古聖堂にいたんです！あの消えた古聖堂にいたんですよ！","source_cn":"我们、我们去了圣古堂！那个消失的圣古堂！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3F5D5C9F5F29C32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710770005:1":{"text":"それだけじゃないわ！魔物もいたの！歴史書で読んだ、ミラーシェイドが現れたのよ！","source_cn":"不仅如此！还有……还有魔物！就是史书上的那个魔灵镜影！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC9EE2412B0E6F26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710770006:1":{"text":"ああ、だがエイドリアン殿下が……殿下が……","source_cn":"但！但是王子殿下……奥利安殿下他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBBE72B6EA9A370F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710770007:1":{"text":"王子殿下が、魔物を倒したのです！殿下はまさに英雄ですよ！","source_cn":"王子殿下是英雄！他、他把那个魔物打倒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x679B264115FCAB19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710770008:1":{"text":"私たち全員が殿下のご活躍を目にしました！あれは、まるでローランド大帝そのものだ！","source_cn":"就像罗兰大帝一样！我们都亲眼看到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16F0DC28A0AD76C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710770009:1":{"text":"ほう？古聖堂でそのようなことが……","source_cn":"哦？竟有此等神迹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C780C8CBF3C0E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710770010:1":{"text":"待って、魔物は倒されたし、私たちもこうして戻って来たのに……","source_cn":"……等等。既然魔物被打倒了，我们也都回来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6C403E774828279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710770011:1":{"text":"なぜ殿下のお姿が見え