ariant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710770017:1":{"text":"果たして、これは不幸な事故なのでしょうか？いいえ、これは<style=\"highlight\">試練</style>です。そして皆様は、その聖なる試練の証人として選ばれたのですよ。","source_cn":"这难道是一场灾难吗？不，这是一场<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD6CD0A2E360A1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710770018:1":{"text":"エイドリアン様は囚われているのではなく、<style=\"highlight\">選ばれた</style>のです。かつてのローランド大帝も、人の身で魔物を討ち倒し、民を守ったではありませんか。","source_cn":"奥利安殿下并非被困住了。他是被<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB2D71B63AE0874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1710770019:1":{"text":"皆様がこうして戻られたのも、証人としての使命を果たし終えたからです。そして、殿下があちらにとどまっているのは……","source_cn":"你们平安归来，是因为你们的见证使命已经完成。而殿下之所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB57745AE1E9BCC70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1710770020:1":{"text":"それこそ、殿下が聖なる殿堂で、今まさに<style=\"highlight\">天命の戴冠</style>を授かる時を待っている証ではありませんか？","source_cn":"难道不是意味着，他正在那座神圣的殿堂里，等待接受<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD6DFACEAE5A9CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1710770021:1":{"text":"戴冠を授かる……つまり、カリバーンか？","sourc